    {
      "id": "core-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 205,
      "width": 334.90000000000015,
      "height": 255,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a8a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8005,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "标准 attention：\n1. S = Q K^T 写 HBM\n2. softmax(S) 写 HBM\n3. P V 再读 HBM\n\nv1 改写为：\n按 Q tile 和 K/V tile 流式扫描\n只在 SRAM/register 中保留局部 S、P\n每行维护 m、l、acc，最后 acc/l 得 O\n\n代价：反向传播重算局部 S/P\n收益：中间矩阵显存从 O(N^2) 降到 O(Nd)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "标准 attention：\n1. S = Q K^T 写 HBM\n2. softmax(S) 写 HBM\n3. P V 再读 HBM\n\nv1 改写为：\n按 Q tile 和 K/V tile 流式扫描\n只在 SRAM/register 中保留局部 S、P\n每行维护 m、l、acc，最后 acc/l 得 O\n\n代价：反向传播重算局部 S/P\n收益：中间矩阵显存从 O(N^2) 降到 O(Nd)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
